              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kuva i Tapuwa, urwo rubibe rwagenda rwerekeye i burengerazuba, rukarinda rushika ku kagezi kitwa Kana; maze rukagarukira ku kiyaga. Iyo ni yo shamvu y’ Abefurayimu, nk’ukw amazu yabo ari, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JOS.16.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JOS.16.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
